---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - My Tuition Center">
  <main id="page-terms" class="page">
    <section style="background:var(--color-surface-dark);padding:var(--sp-section) 0 var(--sp-xxl);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-eyebrow" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);">Legal</div>
        <h1 class="display-lg" style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:var(--sp-sm);">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);">Last updated: <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);">July 10, 2025</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Effective: <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);">July 10, 2025</strong></p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section style="background:var(--color-canvas);padding:var(--sp-section) 0;">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="legal-layout">
          <!-- TOC -->
          <nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
            <p style="font-size: 14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:var(--sp-sm);">Contents</p>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="#terms-1" class="legal-toc-link">1. Acceptance of Terms</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-2" class="legal-toc-link">2. Use of Services</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-3" class="legal-toc-link">3. Accounts & Registration</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-4" class="legal-toc-link">4. Payments & Refunds</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-5" class="legal-toc-link">5. Intellectual Property</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-6" class="legal-toc-link">6. Prohibited Conduct</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-7" class="legal-toc-link">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-8" class="legal-toc-link">8. Limitation of Liability</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-9" class="legal-toc-link">9. Termination</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-10" class="legal-toc-link"> Governing Law</a></li>
              <li><a href="#terms-11" class="legal-toc-link"> Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
          </nav>
          <!-- Prose -->
          <div class="legal-prose">
            <p class="legal-intro">These Terms of Service govern your access to and use of the My Tuition Center platform, website, and educational services. Please read them carefully before using our services.</p>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-1">
              <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
              <p>By accessing or using My Tuition Center's website, platform, or services, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to all terms, you may not use our services. These Terms apply to all visitors, students, parents, educators, and other users.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-2">
              <h2>2. Use of Services</h2>
              <p>My Tuition Center provides online tutoring, course access, and educational resources. Our services are intended for personal, non-commercial educational use. You agree to use our platform only for lawful purposes and in a manner consistent with these Terms and applicable laws in Pakistan.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-3">
              <h2>3. Accounts &amp; Registration</h2>
              <p>To access certain features you must create an account. You are responsible for:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials</li>
                <li>All activities that occur under your account</li>
                <li>Providing accurate and truthful registration information</li>
                <li>Notifying us immediately of any unauthorised use</li>
              </ul>
              <p>You must be at least 13 years old to create an account. Users under 18 require parental consent.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-4">
              <h2>4. Payments &amp; Refunds</h2>
              <p><strong>Trial sessions</strong> are free of charge with no credit card required.</p>
              <p><strong>Course fees</strong> are displayed in Pakistani Rupees (PKR) and are due in advance. We accept bank transfer, EasyPaisa, JazzCash, and major debit/credit cards.</p>
              <p><strong>Refund policy:</strong></p>
              <ul>
                <li>Full refund if cancelled more than 48 hours before the first paid session</li>
                <li>50% refund if cancelled 24–48 hours before the first session</li>
                <li>No refund for cancellations within 24 hours of the session</li>
                <li>Technical failures attributable to My Tuition Center will be compensated with a replacement session</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-5">
              <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
              <p>All course materials, videos, worksheets, assessments, and content created by My Tuition Center or its tutors remain the intellectual property of My Tuition Center. You may not:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Record, reproduce, or distribute session content without written permission</li>
                <li>Share login credentials or course access with non-enrolled users</li>
                <li>Use our content for commercial purposes</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-6">
              <h2>6. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
              <p>You agree not to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Harass, bully, or intimidate tutors, staff, or other students</li>
                <li>Post or share inappropriate, offensive, or illegal content on our platform</li>
                <li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to our systems or other users' accounts</li>
                <li>Use automated tools to scrape, crawl, or download platform content</li>
                <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
              </ul>
              <p>Violations may result in immediate account suspension without refund.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-7">
              <h2>7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
              <p>Our services are provided "as is" and "as available." While we strive for excellence, My Tuition Center makes no guarantee that: the platform will be uninterrupted or error-free; specific academic results will be achieved; or that all content is error-free. Educational outcomes depend on many factors including individual student effort.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-8">
              <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
              <p>To the fullest extent permitted by Pakistani law, My Tuition Center shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of our services. Our total liability shall not exceed the amount you paid us in the 3 months preceding the claim.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-9">
              <h2>9. Termination</h2>
              <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any time for violation of these Terms, fraudulent activity, or conduct harmful to other users or staff. You may delete your account at any time from your profile settings. Upon termination, your access to paid content ceases; refund eligibility is governed by Section 4.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-10">
              <h2> Governing Law</h2>
              <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Karachi, Sindh.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="terms-11">
              <h2> Contact</h2>
              <p>For questions about these Terms:</p>
              <div class="legal-contact-card">
                <strong>My Tuition Center , Legal</strong><br>
                Sana Square, Nishtar Road, Garden West, Karachi 75540<br>
                📧 <a href="mailto:mutuitioncenter01@gmail.com" style="color:var(--color-link);">mutuitioncenter01@gmail.com</a><br>
                📞 +92 370 3438352
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bottom CTA -->
            <div class="legal-bottom-cta">
              <p>Questions about our policies?</p>
              <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
              <a href="/privacy" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-left:var(--sp-sm);">View Privacy Policy</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
